%% Rasid Platform - Data Flow Diagrams

%% 1. Request Lifecycle Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant N as Nginx Gateway
    participant S as Service
    participant A as Auth Middleware
    participant T as Tenant Middleware
    participant V as Validation (Zod)
    participant SVC as Service Layer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Redis Cache

    C->>N: HTTP Request
    N->>N: Rate Limit Check (100r/s)
    N->>S: Proxy to Service
    S->>A: JWT Verification
    A->>A: Decode & Verify Token
    A->>T: Attach User Context
    T->>T: Extract tenantId
    T->>V: Attach Tenant Context
    V->>V: Zod Schema Validation
    V->>SVC: Validated Request
    SVC->>R: Check Cache
    alt Cache Hit
        R-->>SVC: Cached Response
    else Cache Miss
        SVC->>DB: Query (scoped by tenantId)
        DB-->>SVC: Result
        SVC->>R: Store in Cache
    end
    SVC-->>C: JSON Response

---

%% 2. Document Ingestion Pipeline
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant DS as Data Service
    participant FI as File Ingestion
    participant CL as Classification
    participant RD as Reading Engine
    participant OCR as OCR/Vision
    participant MN as MinIO Storage
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant ES as Elasticsearch

    U->>DS: Upload File(s)
    DS->>MN: Store Raw File
    DS->>FI: Ingest File
    FI->>CL: Classify File Type
    CL->>CL: Detect: PDF/Excel/Word/Image/...
    alt Image/Scanned PDF
        CL->>OCR: OCR Processing (Tesseract)
        OCR-->>CL: Extracted Text
    end
    CL->>RD: Parse Content
    RD->>RD: Extract Tables/Text/Metadata
    RD->>PG: Store Parsed Data
    RD->>ES: Index for Search
    RD-->>U: Processing Complete

---

%% 3. Document Replication Pipeline
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant REP as Replication Service
    participant VIS as Visual Analyzer
    participant STY as Style Extractor
    participant LAY as Layout Generator
    participant REN as Rendering Environment
    participant PIX as Pixel Validation
    participant MN as MinIO

    U->>REP: Upload Source Document
    REP->>MN: Store Original
    REP->>VIS: Analyze Visual Layout
    VIS->>VIS: Extract Bounding Boxes
    VIS->>STY: Extract Styles
    STY->>STY: Fonts, Colors, Spacing
    STY->>LAY: Generate Layout HTML
    LAY->>REN: Render to Image (Chromium)
    REN-->>PIX: Rendered Image
    PIX->>PIX: Pixel-by-Pixel Compare
    alt Match < Threshold
        PIX->>LAY: Adjust & Re-render
        LAY->>REN: Re-render
    end
    PIX-->>U: Validated Replica

---

%% 4. Translation Pipeline
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant LOC as Localization Service
    participant TE as Translation Engine
    participant GLO as Glossary Manager
    participant QA as Quality Assurance
    participant RTL as RTL Engine
    participant AI as OpenAI GPT-4o

    U->>LOC: Submit Document for Translation
    LOC->>TE: Extract Translatable Content
    TE->>GLO: Lookup Glossary Terms
    GLO-->>TE: Domain-Specific Terms
    TE->>AI: Translate with Context
    AI-->>TE: Translated Text
    TE->>QA: Quality Check
    QA->>QA: Consistency/Grammar/Terminology
    QA->>RTL: Apply RTL Layout
    RTL->>RTL: Adjust Direction/Alignment
    RTL-->>U: Localized Document

---

%% 5. Export Generation Pipeline
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant SVC as Any Engine Service
    participant EXP as Export Engine
    participant TPL as Template Service
    participant REN as Rendering Environment
    participant MN as MinIO Storage

    U->>SVC: Request Export (PDF/PPTX/XLSX/...)
    SVC->>TPL: Get Template/Theme
    TPL-->>SVC: Template Config
    SVC->>EXP: Generate Document
    EXP->>EXP: Build Content Structure
    alt Needs Rendering
        EXP->>REN: HTML-to-Image/PDF
        REN-->>EXP: Rendered Output
    end
    EXP->>MN: Store Generated File
    EXP-->>U: Download URL
